  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I just thought about this and I thought it would be very interesting and cool to have the option to quickly record something not that long like 30 seconds or so and be able to post it on your so called \"story\" or maybe named something else that last for maybe 12 or 24 hours or whatever without it saving to you pc onto your vrc profile in game. This would possibly have the option to download to your pc or not and would be visible on your friends profile and only to your friends unless there could be an option to make it public or private to only certain people. Idk if this is actually stupid or not but I thought it might be a cool feature in the game and would show what your up to and let your friends know as well being able to share it to others via a public friend video similar to how Snapchat uses its story. What do you think? I think it would be a fun and cool feature to get in on what your friends are up to and be able to share your fun and experience with others",
